## The partners' marks

    Files       assets/partners/, two per partner, named in
                src/partners/roster.js
    Licence     NOT GPLv3. Each mark is its owner's trade mark, used with
                their permission to show them as a WebFPV partner.

Four partners back WebFPV: Global Drone Solutions, Mantis FPV and the West
Coast Multirotor Club, agreed with the owner in September 2026, and
weBLEEDfpv, the USA micro drone partner, added on 2026-10-20. Their marks
