    supplied it. `mantisfpv/mono.svg` is made from it by
    scripts/partners.js: the same letters in one colour.
  * `wcmrc/colour.png` is the club's logo as supplied, a 708 by 252 PNG.
    `wcmrc/mono.png` is made from it by scripts/partners.js, every pixel
    cream and its transparency kept.
  * `webleedfpv/colour.png` is the weBLEEDfpv sticker logo (the name over a
    drone, with "United we Fly, Together"), supplied by the owner on
    2026-10-20 as an 8000 by 3373 PNG with transparency and scaled to 1200
    by 506. `webleedfpv/mono.png` is their other mark, the plain black
    "weBLEEDfpv" wordmark with the drop and ".com", also supplied by the
    owner, scaled to 1200 wide and turned into cream by its darkness (black
    is solid, white is clear) once, with a script written for the purpose,
    not by scripts/partners.js. It is a different shape from the colour mark
    (roster `monoAspect`) because a row of marks at one height needs the
    long one.
  * `mattsflooring/colour.png` is the Matt's Flooring logo as supplied, a
    499 by 111 PNG. `mattsflooring/mono.png` is made from it by
    scripts/partners.js, every pixel cream and its transparency kept.
  * `yourfpv/colour.png` is the YourFPV logo as supplied, a 869 by 570 PNG
    with transparency. YourFPV is a 6 month paid supporter (October 2026 to
    April 2027) shown on freestyle maps and the landing page, but not
    counted in the partners list. `yourfpv/mono.png` is made from it by
    scripts/partners.js, every pixel cream and its transparency kept.
  * `helloradiosky/colour.png` and `helloradiosky/mono.png` are a text
    PLACEHOLDER for HelloRadioSky, drawn by WebFPV for a mock-up on branch
