## Nick Burns' house: his manga render, his logo and the hall's picture

    Files       assets/house/nick-manga.webp and assets/house/nb-sheet.webp
    Licence     NOT GPLv3. Nick Burns' likeness and his mark, shown on his
                house's map with his permission, as the owner states it,
                and a picture the owner supplied for that map.

`nick-manga.webp` is cut from a manga render of Nick Burns that the owner
made with Grok and gave on 2026-10-19, the second of two (the first, given
on 2026-10-18, was used until then): seven side views of him walking and
six of his face, which came cut from the grey they were drawn on. One side
