view's head. The top 512 px of `nb-sheet.webp` is Nick Burns' NB logo as
the owner supplied it on 2026-10-18, a 2048 px JPEG on white, cut from the
white and set on a die cut white border, 512 px (it was `nb-sticker.webp`
